; Ozbound level data: the starter meadow.
;
; Lines starting with ';' are comments (a '#' is the rock tile, so it cannot start one).
; Blank lines are ignored. Sections may appear in any order, each at most once.
; Required sections: [map], [player], [guide]. Optional: [moonpetals], [nodes].
;
; Coordinates are "x y" in tiles. x counts right from the left edge; y counts UP from the
; BOTTOM row of [map] (the last row listed is y = 0).

